#23497
Battle!~
You have boldly entered the heart of a raging battle between the knights 
of Camelot and the barbaric Picots. The knights have set up a skirmish 
line across the field, spreading out the Picots, while two cavalry units 
are sweeping around the ends in a pincher like move. Holding the center 
of the line are several knights of renown. The Picots are faring badly, 
as their leader has already left the field in cowardly retreat.
~
